---
description: Attaches the Noto error classification skill when Noto domain Go files are in context.
globs: **/domains/noto/internal/noto/**/*.go
alwaysApply: false
---

Noto distinguishes reverts from internal errors at assemble and endorse, and the right answer depends on who supplied the rejected data in each phase.

Before adding, moving or changing any error return, validation check or helper on the ValidateParams, Assemble or Endorse paths, read `domains/noto/.claude/skills/noto-error-classification/SKILL.md` and follow its procedure and reporting requirement.
